window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Hidden powers are awakening...</p> <p>Finally safe with her new family, Morelle is ready to embrace her future, but when an unexpected burst of power reveals abilities beyond her understanding, she must face the truth about her nature and choose between sharing it with those she loves or continue keeping them in the dark.</p> <p>Some gifts come with a price, and Morelle must decide whether she's willing to pay it.</p>"; 
